For decades, the advice was simple.

3
00:00:04,632 --> 00:00:05,481
Go to college,

4
00:00:05,481 --> 00:00:06,573
get an office job,

5
00:00:06,573 --> 00:00:08,756
and you'll do better than the people

6
00:00:08,756 --> 00:00:10,332
who work with their hands.

7
00:00:10,512 --> 00:00:11,468
For many people,

8
00:00:11,468 --> 00:00:12,602
that advice worked.

9
00:00:12,782 --> 00:00:15,058
But something quiet has been happening.

10
00:00:15,238 --> 00:00:18,073
Many plumbers and electricians now earn more

11
00:00:18,073 --> 00:00:19,555
than the median worker,

12
00:00:19,555 --> 00:00:21,359
