And that's just the middle.

86
00:03:04,336 --> 00:03:07,313
Experienced tradespeople in high cost cities,

87
00:03:07,313 --> 00:03:08,768
in specialized fields,

88
00:03:08,768 --> 00:03:11,018
or in strong unions often earn far

89
00:03:11,018 --> 00:03:13,201
more, with the top ten percent of

90
00:03:13,201 --> 00:03:16,773
