99
00:03:35,104 --> 00:03:37,813
Some office careers pay much more,

100
00:03:37,813 --> 00:03:40,920
of course, like engineering or finance.

101
00:03:41,100 --> 00:03:43,238
But the idea that hands on work

102
00:03:43,238 --> 00:03:46,134
