103
00:03:46,134 --> 00:03:46,755
the data.

104
00:03:47,105 --> 00:03:47,975
In real life.

105
00:03:48,155 --> 00:03:50,618
Picture a journeyman electrician in a mid

106
00:03:50,618 --> 00:03:53,321
sized city earning around thirty five dollars

107
00:03:53,321 --> 00:03:55,844
an hour, which is roughly seventy thousand

108
00:03:55,844 --> 00:03:57,887
dollars a year at full time hours,

109
