116
00:04:10,890 --> 00:04:12,201
Advantage 2.

117
00:04:12,381 --> 00:04:13,229
Paid to learn.

118
00:04:13,409 --> 00:04:15,336
apprentices earn while they train

119
00:04:15,687 --> 00:04:16,998
Advantage two.

120
00:04:17,178 --> 00:04:18,525
You get paid to learn.

121
00:04:18,705 --> 00:04:22,643
Most plumbers and electricians train through apprenticeships,

122
00:04:22,643 --> 00:04:25,161
