149
00:05:19,063 --> 00:05:20,336
with raises each year.

150
00:05:20,516 --> 00:05:21,766
By the fourth year,

151
00:05:21,766 --> 00:05:23,543
the wage may be in the high

152
00:05:23,543 --> 00:05:24,661
