155
00:05:30,346 --> 00:05:31,704
Advantage 3.

156
00:05:31,884 --> 00:05:33,625
Little or no student debt.

157
00:05:33,805 --> 00:05:36,534
starting at zero instead of below zero

158
00:05:36,884 --> 00:05:38,103
Advantage three.

159
00:05:38,283 --> 00:05:40,036
Little or no student debt.

160
00:05:40,216 --> 00:05:42,927
Millions of Americans carry student loans,

161
00:05:42,927 --> 00:05:45,832
and many college graduates leave school owing

162
00:05:45,832 --> 00:05:47,704
