169
00:06:01,963 --> 00:06:04,360
Some trade school courses cost money,

170
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:06,433
but usually far less than a four

171
00:06:06,433 --> 00:06:07,210
year degree.

172
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:10,442
That means the tradesperson often starts their

173
00:06:10,442 --> 00:06:11,437
career at zero,

174
00:06:11,437 --> 00:06:13,892
while the graduate starts below zero.

175
00:06:14,242 --> 00:06:16,482
That difference matters more than it seems.

176
00:06:16,662 --> 00:06:19,177
A three hundred dollar monthly loan payment

177
00:06:19,177 --> 00:06:21,283
