178
00:06:21,283 --> 00:06:23,915
dollars that could have gone into investments

179
00:06:23,915 --> 00:06:24,383
instead.

180
00:06:24,563 --> 00:06:27,344
Invested at an illustrative seven percent a

181
00:06:27,344 --> 00:06:29,673
year, that money could grow into far

182
00:06:29,673 --> 00:06:30,902
more over a career.

183
00:06:31,252 --> 00:06:32,041
In real life.

184
00:06:32,221 --> 00:06:34,408
Two twenty three year olds go apartment

185
