195
00:06:51,409 --> 00:06:52,570
Advantage 4.

196
00:06:52,750 --> 00:06:54,166
A four year head start.

197
00:06:54,346 --> 00:06:56,587
earning while others are still in school

198
00:06:56,937 --> 00:06:58,132
Advantage four.

199
00:06:58,312 --> 00:06:59,183
A head start.

200
00:06:59,363 --> 00:07:02,108
An eighteen year old apprentice starts earning

201
00:07:02,108 --> 00:07:02,765
right away.

202
00:07:02,945 --> 00:07:05,754
An eighteen year old college student usually

203
00:07:05,754 --> 00:07:08,181
