215
00:07:32,548 --> 00:07:35,473
It also means four years of experience.

216
00:07:35,653 --> 00:07:36,438
By twenty two,

217
00:07:36,438 --> 00:07:38,569
an apprentice may be close to becoming

218
00:07:38,569 --> 00:07:39,803
a licensed journeyman,

219
00:07:39,803 --> 00:07:41,877
while the graduate is starting at the

220
00:07:41,877 --> 00:07:43,560
bottom of a new career ladder.

221
00:07:43,740 --> 00:07:46,757
Experience is what raises pay in both

222
00:07:46,757 --> 00:07:47,246
paths.

223
00:07:47,596 --> 00:07:48,455
In real life.

224
00:07:48,635 --> 00:07:51,141
Picture the day a college senior walks

225
00:07:51,141 --> 00:07:53,186
