231
00:08:04,622 --> 00:08:07,582
Same age, very different starting lines.

232
00:08:07,933 --> 00:08:09,140
Advantage 5.

233
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:11,514
Overtime and emergency pay.

234
00:08:11,694 --> 00:08:13,328
when the lights go out,

235
00:08:13,328 --> 00:08:14,109
rates go up

236
00:08:14,460 --> 00:08:15,690
Advantage five.

237
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:18,018
Overtime and emergency pay.

238
00:08:18,198 --> 00:08:19,729
Pipes burst at night,

239
00:08:19,729 --> 00:08:21,624
power fails during storms,

240
00:08:21,624 --> 00:08:24,758
