00:34:53,716 --> 00:34:55,862
Your answer could help someone who's just

1020
00:34:55,862 --> 00:34:56,386
beginning.

1021
00:34:56,566 --> 00:34:57,889
I'm Ryan Rover.

1022
00:34:58,069 --> 00:34:59,253
Respect the trades,

1023
00:34:59,253 --> 00:35:00,374
build your wealth,

